{"type":"message","id":"ee91cebf","parentId":"2d4902e2","timestamp":"2026-04-11T22:00:20.898Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_0bc6c1d29c1e425d958fc434","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 2026-04-11 (토)\n\n## Security Audit\n- Daily security audit ran at 03:00 KST — 2 critical issues, 4 warnings\n- Critical issues: open groups with elevated tools enabled, runtime/fs exposure on Telegram\n- Warnings: trusted proxies missing, autoAllowSkills enabled, multi-user heuristic detected, permissive plugin tool policy\n- False positives ignored: claude-mem (8 critical), writing-skills (1 critical), tavily (2 critical)\n\n## Cron Health\n- periodic-memory-maintenance: error, consecutiveErrors=2 (Telegram @heartbeat not found)\n- daily-github-backup: local commits succeeded (37 files, 17232 insertions, 831 deletions), but GitHub push failed with HTTP 403 (Permission denied to Lfantasial) — token expired or permission issue\n\n## System Status\n- 6/8 cron jobs healthy (daily-morning-briefing, daily-security-audit, daily-update-check, notion-daily-briefing, github-repo-daily-briefing, workspace-heartbeat)\n- 2 jobs in error state (daily-github-backup push failure, periodic-memory-maintenance Telegram channel not found)\n- No cron jobs newly entered non-ok state\n- No cron jobs resolved since 2026-04-10 check\n\n## Morning Briefing (07:00 KST)\n- Weather: Partly cloudy 8°C (feels like 7°C), 7 km/h wind, 100% humidity, no precipitation\n- System: 6/8 cron jobs healthy\n- Action priority: (1) Verify GitHub token for daily-github-backup, (2) Fix periodic-memory-maintenance Telegram channel target\n\n## Heartbeat Notes\n- 2026-04-10 last check at 21:36 KST found periodic-memory-maintenance error persisting\n- New daily memory file created for 2026-04-11\n- Security audit findings consistent with previous day\n- daily-update-check at 06:00 KST: OpenClaw and skills up to date, no updates required\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775944820894}}
