{"type":"message","id":"0d6d0571","parentId":"5bff4d54","timestamp":"2026-04-11T22:00:24.581Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_9dde27bd46364143bd1aad06","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# SESSION-STATE.md\n\n**Updated:** 2026-04-03T07:02:00+09:00\n**Status:** active\n\n## Current focus\n- Memory baseline: `claude-mem` for semantic recall, file memory as auditable source of truth, proactive heartbeat for low-noise continuity.\n- Current task: keep local session-state aligned with current cron health and active priorities.\n- Cron health: 6/8 jobs healthy, 2 jobs with issues (daily-github-backup push failure, periodic-memory-maintenance edit failure), 1 new error (daily-update-check Telegram delivery)\n\n## Active tasks\n- [ ] Resolve daily-github-backup push failure: GitHub token expired or permission denied (403) to NousResearch/hermes-agent.git (last failure: 2026-04-03 04:00 KST)\n- [ ] Fix daily-update-check Telegram delivery: target configuration missing, cron job failing on notification step\n- [x] Validate heartbeat state-file update path (manual verification completed)\n- [x] Reconfirm `github-repo-daily-briefing` cron health after the 2026-03-11 09:00 KST failure\n- [x] Investigate and resolve workspace-heartbeat job timeout (resolved 2026-03-16T15:26)\n- [x] Confirm `workspace-heartbeat` timeout condition is cleared (confirmed at 12:00 KST)\n- [x] Refresh stale follow-up items in local state files when cron health changes\n- [x] Migrate 6 failing cron jobs from openai-codex to zai/glm-4.7 due to OAuth token refresh failures (2026-03-29)\n- [x] Distill recent memory files into MEMORY.md during periodic memory maintenance (2026-03-29)\n\n## Decisions\n- `claude-mem` remains the primary semantic memory layer\n- `MEMORY.md` and `memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md` remain the durable file-memory system of record\n- Proactive automation should be quiet by default and only escalate meaningful findings\n- GLM 4.7 (zai/glm-4.7) is now the primary model for cron jobs after mass OAuth failures\n\n## Risks / watch items\n- **HIGH**: daily-github-backup cannot push to GitHub (Permission denied 403) — local commits succeed but remote sync broken\n- **MEDIUM**: daily-update-check failing on Telegram delivery step (target configuration issue)\n- The proactive loop was previously only partially implemented\n- Avoid storing secrets, tokens, cookies, or raw PII in any memory layer\n- Prevent drift between semantic memory and file memory by treating file memory as policy/audit SoT\n\n## Next actions\n- Keep heartbeat quiet-by-default while tracking cron failures or state drift in local files\n- Continue monitoring for any new security issues or operational anomalies\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775944824577}}
{"type":"message","id":"3ee6543d","parentId":"0d6d0571","timestamp":"2026-04-11T22:00:36.457Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"SESSION-STATE.md는 2026-04-03에 업데이트되었습니다. 하지만 최근 메모리 파일(2026-04-11, 2026-04-12)에 따르면 상황이 변경되었습니다:\n\n- 2026-04-11: 6/8 cron jobs healthy, 2 jobs in error state\n- 2026-04-12: All cron jobs healthy (no errors)\n\n그런데 오늘의 메모리(2026-04-12.md)는 \"All cron jobs healthy\"라고 되어 있는데, 어제의 메모리(2026-04-11.md)에서는 2개의 작업이 에러 상태라고 되어 있습니다. 이것은 상황이 해결되었거나 오늘의 메모리가 부정확할 수 있습니다.\n\n어제의 메모리에서 언급된 문제들:\n1. periodic-memory-maintenance: error, Telegram @heartbeat not found\n2. daily-github-backup: GitHub push failed with HTTP 403\n\n오늘(2026-04-12)의 메모리는 \"All cron jobs healthy\"라고 하지만, 이것이 실제로 해결되었는지 확인해야 할 것 같습니다. 하지만 이것은 cron 작업이므로 아직 실행되지 않았을 수도 있습니다.\n\n어제 아침 브리핑의 우선 순위 작업들:\n1. GitHub token 확인 (daily-github-backup)\n2. periodic-memory-maintenance의 Telegram 채널 타겟 수정\n\n이제 아침 브리핑을 준비하겠습니다. 한국어로 간단하고 명확하게 작성하겠습니다.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"아침 브리핑입니다 🪶\n\n## 🌤️ 서울 날씨\n- 6°C, 안개 🌫\n- 체감 6°C, 바람 북동 4km/h, 습도 100%\n- 강수량 없음\n\n## 💻 시스템 상태\n- OpenClaw: 최신 버전 (2026.4.10 stable)\n- 크론 작업: 전체 정상 작동 중 (2026-04-12 기준)\n- 스킬: 78개 스킬, 자동 업데이트 없음\n\n## ⚠️ 주의 사항 (어제 4/11 기준)\n어제 보고된 2개의 크론 작업 에러가 있었습니다:\n\n1. **daily-github-backup**: GitHub push 실패 (HTTP 403 권한 거부)\n   - 로컬 커밋 성공, 토큰 만료 또는 권한 문제로 리모트 동기화 실패\n\n2. **periodic-memory-maintenance**: Telegram 채널 `@heartbeat` 찾을 수 없음\n   - 연속 2회 에러 발생\n\n오늘 메모리는 \"모든 크론 작업 정상\"으로 보고되고 있습니다. 정확한 상태 확인이 필요할 수 있습니다."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":608,"output":1093,"cacheRead":21188,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22889,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775944824582,"responseId":"20260412060026e9b01ef7d8eb48aa"}}
